Error [E1202]: the workspace lock `.jet/lock` is malformed or stale
 Why: workspace membership and overlay facts must match the current `workspace.jet` and Package sources
 Fix: run `jetpack env` from the workspace root after fixing the workspace or Package sources

Error [E1202]: the workspace lock `.jet/lock` could not be written
 Why: the workspace index is not usable until the lock write succeeds: permission denied
 Fix: fix the workspace lock directory permissions or storage error, then run `jetpack env` again
